 and its bounds, the 32 waiting starts, a batch that needs room for its first match only, a held start that waits and is not dropped (and moves the starts after it), a stop of one waiting start and of all, the waiting starts that go on while the schedules are off, the catalog's bounded loads, and the store of the lists (the defaults are no row, an empty list or a name twice is no list).",
